<title>UK: Daimler H1 97 oper profit 1.849 bln dm.</title>
<headline>Daimler H1 97 oper profit 1.849 bln dm.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997 (in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group oper profit			   1,849  vs 827</p>
<p>    Group sales				  55,900  vs 49,100</p>
<p>    Group net profit				992  vs 782</p>
<p>    Auto operations oper profit		1,429 vs 1,409</p>
<p>    Car turnover				  24,980 vs 22,409</p>
<p>    Car turnover (units)		     335,794 vs 318,063</p>
<p>    Truck turnover				17,846 vs 15,346</p>
<p>    Truck turnover (units)		   191,994 vs 168,376</p>
<p>    Aerospace oper profit			   74 vs 677 loss</p>
<p>    Services unit				    220 vs 212</p>
<p>    Directly managed businesses		  134 vs 132</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German industrial group is Daimler-Benz AG. The company also said operating profit from its truck unit was slightly negative.</p>
<p>--Bonn Newsroom + 49 228 260 97150</p>
</text>
